{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/29/8662091/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Zepp Nagoyaが終わりました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋のみなさん\nありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/29/8662091/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"札幌、福岡、大阪、名古屋...\n残すところ昼夜2公演！\n明日が最後、東京！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブは全員で作り上げるもの\nだから助け合わなきゃ。\n一実の脚、早く治りますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/29/8662091/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コール聞こえてるよ。\n団扇もタオルもしっかり見えてるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"zeppはみなさんとの距離が近いから\nみなさんの表情まで\nしっかりと見えるんだよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/29/8662091/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ね！見えてますよ。\nすごーい嬉しいんだよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのサイリウムに囲まれて\n歌って踊ってる時間はほんとに幸せ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日の東京公演は\nゆきなも参加します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/29/8662091/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生のみんなも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/29/8662091/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで頑張ろう。\nそして楽しみましょっ！\n夏休み最後にいっぱい\nはっちゃけちゃいましょっ！\nいい汗流そうー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/08/29/8662091/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、\n明日に向けておやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}